# What Packagist distributes is a tag's git archive (GitHub's zipball of it), which Composer
# installs: the module's files and, in vendor/, the libraries it embeds (tools/embed.php vendor).
# The repository's tests, tools, pinned SDK and CI stay out of it, as they stay out of the package
# tools/build.php builds; the CI checks that the two hold the same files, byte for byte.
# GitHub's archives match these paths case-sensitively: /sdk is the pinned SDK, never Sdk/.
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/Test export-ignore
/phpcs.xml.dist export-ignore
/phpstan.neon.dist export-ignore
/sdk export-ignore
/tools export-ignore
